<title>UNITED NATIONS: UN SecCouncil president say Iraq deal takes effect.</title>
<headline>UN SecCouncil president say Iraq deal takes effect.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the United Nations Security Council, Italy's Francesco Fulci, confirmed Monday that the oil-for-food deal with Iraq takes effect from 0001 EST/0501 GMT Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;In my capacity as president I received the Secretary General's report as required by paragraph 13 (of the resolution 986) saying all actions to ensure it is in effect have been completed,&quot; Fulci told reporters after the council met late on Monday.</p>
</text>
